{"hash": "a9be3a49049bcb3a", "t": ["Classic computer emulator in your browser — Desktop", "A serverless classic computer emulator in your browser: desktop, local files, an interpreter, productivity tools and games, with snapshots and disk import.", "Classic computer emulator running entirely in your browser", "MDM1 · Free apps", "This app is a classic computer emulator that runs entirely in your browser with no server. It provides a desktop with draggable windows, a virtual file system saved locally in your browser, a real-time CPU instruction interpreter, and native productivity tools like a text editor, drawing app, calculator, and file manager, plus small games. You can create and save files, draw images and export them, run assembly programs step by step, and play Snake, with snapshot saving and compatible disk import. All data stays on your device and is never sent to any server. You can use a keyboard or game controller.", "Files", "Editor", "Drawing", "Calculator", "CPU", "Snake", "Settings", "Files", "Editor", "Drawing", "Calculator", "CPU", "Snake", "Settings", "Ready", "FAQ", "Does the app work offline?", "Yes, everything runs in the browser and no data is sent to any server.", "Where are my files and snapshots saved?", "They are saved in your browser's local storage (localStorage) on your device.", "How do I import a disk (disk image)?", "From the file manager, choose a JSON file containing a list of files, or a text file to add it as a file.", "What instructions does the interpreter support?", "It supports MOV, LOAD, STORE, ADD, SUB, MUL, DIV, CMP, JMP, JZ, JNZ, PUSH, POP, PRINT, HALT, and more.", "Can I use a game controller?", "Yes, in Snake, the game controller (Gamepad API) is read automatically.", "← All apps", "Tools", "No files", "<div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"button\" id=\"filesNewBtn\">Save file</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"filesDeleteBtn\">Delete</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"filesRefreshBtn\">Refresh</button><label>Import disk<input type=\"file\" id=\"filesImportInput\" accept=\".json,.txt\"></label><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"filesExportBtn\">Export disk</button></div><div class=\"app-row\"><div style=\"flex:1\"><div id=\"filesList\" class=\"out\"></div></div><div style=\"flex:1\"><input id=\"filesNameInput\" placeholder=\"File name\"><select id=\"filesTypeSelect\"><option value=\"text\">Text</option><option value=\"image\">Image dataURL</option></select><textarea id=\"filesContentArea\" rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Content\"></textarea></div></div><div id=\"filesExportArea\" class=\"out\"></div>", "File manager", "File", "Saved ", "Deleted", "File not found", "Disk imported", "Imported as text file", "<div class=\"app-row\"><select id=\"editorFileSelect\"><option value=\"\">-- File --</option></select><input id=\"editorFileName\" placeholder=\"File name\"><button class=\"button\" id=\"editorSaveBtn\">Save</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"editorNewBtn\">New</button></div><textarea id=\"editorArea\" rows=\"12\" placeholder=\"Type here...\"></textarea>", "<option value=\"\">-- File --</option>", "Document", "Saved ", "Editor", "<div class=\"app-row\"><input type=\"color\" id=\"paintColor\" value=\"#ffd700\"><input type=\"range\" id=\"paintSize\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" value=\"3\"><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"paintClearBtn\">Clear</button><button class=\"button\" id=\"paintSaveBtn\">Save as File</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"paintExportBtn\">Export</button></div><canvas id=\"paintCanvas\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\"></canvas><div id=\"paintStatus\" class=\"out\"></div>", "drawing_", "Saved: ", "Drawing", "Error", "Calculator", "<textarea id=\"cpuCode\" rows=\"10\">; Example\nMOV R0, 5\nMOV R1, 3\nADD R0, R1\nPRINT R0\nHALT\n</textarea><div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"button\" id=\"cpuRunBtn\">Run</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"cpuStepBtn\">Step</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"cpuResetBtn\">Reset</button></div><div id=\"cpuRegs\" class=\"out\"></div><div id=\"cpuOutput\" class=\"out\"></div>", "[Unknown command: ", "[Step limit exceeded]\n", " | Steps: ", "\n[Halted]", "Processor", "Joystick: Disconnected", "Joystick: Connected", "Game Over! Score: ", "Score: ", "Score: 0", "<canvas id=\"snakeCanvas\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></canvas><div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"button\" id=\"snakeStartBtn\">Start</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"snakePauseBtn\">Pause</button><select id=\"snakeSpeedSelect\"><option value=\"120\">Slow</option><option value=\"80\" selected>Medium</option><option value=\"50\">Fast</option></select></div><div id=\"snakeScore\" class=\"out\">Score: 0</div><div id=\"snakePadStatus\" class=\"out\">Joystick: Disconnected</div>", "Snake", "<div class=\"app-row\"><input id=\"snapshotNameInput\" placeholder=\"Snapshot name\"><button class=\"button\" id=\"saveSnapshotBtn\">Save Snapshot</button></div><div id=\"snapshotList\" class=\"out\"></div><div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"restoreSnapshotBtn\">Restore</button><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"deleteSnapshotBtn\">Delete</button></div><div id=\"settingsStatus\" class=\"out\"></div><div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"button sec\" id=\"bindKeysBtn\">Bind Keyboard</button></div><div id=\"keyBindInfo\" class=\"out\">Shortcuts: Arrow keys for Snake, Ctrl+S to save in editor.</div>", "No snapshots", "Snapshot", "Snapshot saved ", "Select a snapshot", "Restored ", "Deleted", "Settings", "Keyboard bound. Use arrow keys."]}